<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Artwork of ic_splash: ic_launcher_mmd's paths, laid out the way the
     system draws a launch icon: as a 108-unit layer of which only the middle
     72 units show (the icon box; the rest is cropped), so the icon fills the
     box like Calm Chevy's.
     The transform fits the artwork to that box exactly on the Kompakt. There
     the box is 255px and the system draws this layer 382px wide, starting
     64px outside the box (3.537px per unit). Scale 0.890052 with offset
     18.09424 therefore puts the artwork's 81 units on 0..255px: the border's
     outer edge lands on the box edge, nothing cropped and no gray fringe.
     The round numbers (72/81 = 0.8889, offset 18) miss by a third of a pixel:
     one side cropped, the other fringed.
     The group's name is the animation target in ic_splash. -->
